Business: {{ $json.business_name }}
Month: {{ $json.report_month }}
New Reviews This Month: {{ $json.total_new_reviews }}
Average Rating This Month: {{ $json.this_month_avg }} stars
Average Rating Last Month: {{ $json.last_month_avg }} stars
Rating Trend: {{ $json.trend }}
Reviews Responded To: {{ $json.reviews_responded }}
Best Review This Month: {{ $json.best_review }}

Create a complete HTML email with:
1. Professional header with business name and month
2. Summary statistics in a clean table/grid
3. Rating trend section (show improving/stable/declining clearly)
4. Best review quoted in a styled blockquote
5. Exactly 3 specific, actionable recommendations for next month
6. Professional footer

Use clean inline CSS. Make it look premium. Use UK spelling. Address the client directly. Do NOT mention AI. Sign off from their 'Reputation Management Team'.

Return ONLY the HTML, no other text.

